        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amelia expected her evening to be perfectly ordinary. What she did not expect was for her best friend to <strong>hack her car</strong> and bring her against her will to the <strong>Haven</strong>, the ancient castle her family used to holiday in when she was a child.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Far for being a sentimental visit, this improbable return to the place of her childhood finds Amelia forced to take part in a game she knows nothing about: not the how, not the who, and certainly not the why... <strong>And this game just might uncover secrets her family would have rather left hidden.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/08009a91ccc45315948f81f39f822881.poster.avif?t=1775719539\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/08009a91ccc45315948f81f39f822881.webm?t=1775719539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/08009a91ccc45315948f81f39f822881.mp4?t=1775719539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/5f5fb26076e9f5631cf563d63e69bc8d.avif?t=1775719539\" width=600 height=85 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Haven is yours to roam freely</strong> and in any order you want. Search through its handcrafted rooms, find secret passages and open <strong>forbidden doors</strong>. Uncover the castle's history and that of Amelia's family on this larger-than-life, intricate playing board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your observation skills and a <strong>keen sense of curiosity</strong> will be the keys to truly know the Haven and uncover every last of its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/6758205821d6bdfa1d6852be05c787eb.poster.avif?t=1775719539\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/6758205821d6bdfa1d6852be05c787eb.webm?t=1775719539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/6758205821d6bdfa1d6852be05c787eb.mp4?t=1775719539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/58271fc83394588e5f56ab8bc4505b3b.avif?t=1775719539\" width=600 height=85 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own strategies, organise your team, position your fighters wisely and anticipate enemy patterns in <strong>exciting tactical battles</strong> where every choice matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each enemy has a unique behaviour</strong>, and learning them is the key to mastering this unique battle system at the crossroad between puzzle games and RPGs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat is not the end: explore other paths, gather your strength and establish new strategies with <strong>a myriad unique fighters and skills.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/27b251dda5878a48c2087b1663195505.poster.avif?t=1775719539\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/27b251dda5878a48c2087b1663195505.webm?t=1775719539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/27b251dda5878a48c2087b1663195505.mp4?t=1775719539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/ee2a0757a964d7adfd59fda5a7e267d1.avif?t=1775719539\" width=600 height=85 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into a piece of speculative fiction that <strong>questions technology, ethics, and the weight of unspoken family trauma</strong>. Investigate both the present and childhood memories to find out the truth between Amelia's kidnapping, and the true reasons behind the mysterious game she finds herself playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/c4c0038289789ea383b20680fd068f10.poster.avif?t=1775719539\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/c4c0038289789ea383b20680fd068f10.webm?t=1775719539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/c4c0038289789ea383b20680fd068f10.mp4?t=1775719539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904360/extras/eab4f23353cb99f7b9eaee0